Subject: [PATCH 0136/1695] drivers: clk: clk-stm32mp15: fix typo (PMU --> MPU)

Replace PMU by MPU.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git f9932451ce9a063421003c2fde320035e30b81d8 drivers: clk: clk-stm32mp15: fix typo (PMU --> MPU)]
Change-Id: I0fd76f2a18e2f44ce8061ae4129997133b142ce6
Signed-off-by: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
---
 core/drivers/clk/clk-stm32mp15.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/drivers/clk/clk-stm32mp15.c b/core/drivers/clk/clk-stm32mp15.c
index 3b09c846c..9aca8f142 100644
--- a/core/drivers/clk/clk-stm32mp15.c
+++ b/core/drivers/clk/clk-stm32mp15.c
@@ -533,7 +533,7 @@ static const uint8_t stm32mp1_mcu_div[16] = {
 	0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8, 9, 9, 9, 9, 9, 9, 9, 9
 };
 
-/* div = /1 /2 /4 /8 /16 : same divider for PMU and APBX */
+/* div = /1 /2 /4 /8 /16 : same divider for MPU and APBX */
 #define stm32mp1_mpu_div	stm32mp1_mpu_apbx_div
 #define stm32mp1_apbx_div	stm32mp1_mpu_apbx_div
 static const uint8_t stm32mp1_mpu_apbx_div[8] = {
